# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: mtPaint.
Package: mtPaint
Section: Graphics
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport, Iconv
Recommends: TTF-Noto-Color-Emoji
Components: Apps.Graphics.!mtPaint (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk
Description: mtPaint painting program (GTK 3)
 A painting program for pixel art and photos: palettes, layers and
 animation frames; loads and saves PNG, JPEG, GIF and BMP. RISC OS Save
 and Open boxes; Adjust paints with the second colour.
 .
 This is a public beta of the riscos-gtk ports.
Build-Map: !mtPaint -> Apps/Graphics/!mtPaint
Build-Notice: mtPaint, packaged for PackMan from the riscos-gtk release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk/releases
 .
 mtPaint is mtPaint 3.50.14 (mtpaint.sourceforge.net), under the GNU GPL version 3. It is linked with GTK 3 and its
 libraries (LGPL) and includes DejaVu fonts and PThreadTicker. The
 source is offered by the Source file in the application and on the
 release page. Licences follow.
